{"unit_id":"PianoPrince__dsh-workspace-mover#card-zh","repo":"PianoPrince/dsh-workspace-mover","commit":"ed5ab1530692ad85f2941b1b8e4ee22e83042ce9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-mover 是面向 DSH Web 与 Desktop 的会话管理插件，在侧边栏提供跨工作区会话迁移和设置中的会话修复面板，并可注册对话内 agent 工具。它支持单个或批量移动会话、整理失联或归属错误的会话、回收站还原、备份恢复、移动历史撤回和工作区改名。迁移保留会话身份与历史，并提供备份和失败回滚。适合需要整理多个 DSH 工作区或找回会话的用户；需要 DSH 及本地会话档案访问，不需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:24","cordis.patch.yml:12-14","lib/index.js:3958-4020","client/client.js:1901-1925"]}
{"unit_id":"PianoPrince__dsh-workspace-mover#card-en","repo":"PianoPrince/dsh-workspace-mover","commit":"ed5ab1530692ad85f2941b1b8e4ee22e83042ce9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-mover helps DSH Web and Desktop users manage sessions across workspaces. It supports sidebar migration, batch moves, session repair, recycle-bin and backup restoration, move-history undo, and agent tools. Failed moves can roll back. It needs local session archives, with no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:24","cordis.patch.yml:12-14","lib/index.js:3958-4020","client/client.js:1901-1925"]}
